WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.480
Creative writing develops original situations, feelings, dialogue and imagery into

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.536
coherent writing.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:10.481
Which pair of words rhymes? Answer: light and night

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:15.548
Write a vivid short account about a school festival with realistic details.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:19.225
Why it works: Light and night share a final sound.
